{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34746","headline":"奉和袭美题褚家林亭 · 张贲","name":"奉和袭美题褚家林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"疎野林亭震泽西，朗吟闲步喜相携。\n时时风折芦花乱，处处霜摧稻穗低。\n百本败荷鱼不动，一枝寒菊蝶空迷。\n今朝偶得高阳伴，从放山翁醉似泥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张贲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34746.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34746","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}